WEBVTT

00:26.110 --> 00:28.160
I'm impressed.

00:28.160 --> 00:31.620
I think you're the first humans 
to reach this place.

00:31.620 --> 00:33.140
The first in a thousand years.

00:33.140 --> 00:34.520
What? Who—

00:34.840 --> 00:35.670
A human?

00:35.670 --> 00:38.270
Definitely not. This is bad.

00:40.820 --> 00:41.940
Whoops.

00:42.230 --> 00:44.200
You don't have to run.

00:44.200 --> 00:47.880
I don't intend to kill you... yet.

00:48.420 --> 00:49.760
<i>He's so strong.</i>

00:49.760 --> 00:51.080
When did he get there?

00:51.080 --> 00:53.530
<i>I understand why she fled.</i>

00:53.530 --> 00:57.210
<i>He's clearly stronger than any 
of the monsters we've faced so far.</i>

01:01.120 --> 01:03.960
L-Let go of her.

01:03.960 --> 01:05.880
Sagirin...

01:05.880 --> 01:10.080
Don't glare at me. I just want to talk.

01:10.080 --> 01:11.930
Who are you?

01:11.930 --> 01:13.950
A Tensen.

01:14.680 --> 01:19.480
This is the peony spirit, 
Jiujun Amoghavajra.

02:51.480 --> 02:53.860
He's one of those...?

02:53.860 --> 02:56.700
Hoko-san, you're alive?

02:53.940 --> 02:58.940
<b>Umbrella and Ink</b>

02:57.400 --> 02:59.650
That's not enough to kill him.

02:59.650 --> 03:03.240
It'll simply accelerate his transformation, 
turning him completely into a tree.

03:03.240 --> 03:04.290
But...

03:04.290 --> 03:07.210
It is a shame, but this is my fate.

03:07.210 --> 03:11.880
I pray my soul is 
at least invited into Horai.

03:11.880 --> 03:18.640
Yeah, all that stuff about souls 
and Jiujun Whatever is a lie.

03:18.640 --> 03:19.610
What?

03:19.610 --> 03:24.390
It's a convenient lie invented by our master 
to maintain order on the island.

03:24.720 --> 03:27.610
This island is a place 
for conducting experiments on life.

03:27.610 --> 03:32.680
You and all the others are simply 
prototypes produced as part of experiments.

03:32.680 --> 03:34.280
But...

03:34.280 --> 03:39.790
And the humans who come 
to this island are research materials.

03:40.740 --> 03:44.160
These are Kyoshi. I made them using humans.

03:44.390 --> 03:46.940
Made them... using humans?

03:46.940 --> 03:48.040
Yes.

03:48.040 --> 03:50.170
They were originally humans 
who came to the island.

03:50.420 --> 03:52.470
I love toying with humans,

03:52.470 --> 03:54.960
so I always end up playing 
with them like this.

03:54.960 --> 03:56.560
Funny, right?

03:57.800 --> 04:01.020
But this isn't how we typically use humans.

04:01.020 --> 04:03.670
High-quality humans are turned into tan.

04:03.670 --> 04:06.510
Tan... You mean the Elixir of Life?

04:06.510 --> 04:08.120
Elixir of Life?

04:08.120 --> 04:12.530
All the humans who come here 
always say the same thing.

04:12.530 --> 04:14.860
The Elixir of Eternal Life and Youth,

04:14.860 --> 04:18.530
Ochimizu, Tokijiku-no-kagu-no-mi...

04:18.530 --> 04:22.410
Sorry, but there's nothing like that here.

04:23.920 --> 04:26.170
Tan is essential to us,

04:26.170 --> 04:29.020
but if an ordinary human consumes it, 
they turn into a tree.

04:29.020 --> 04:32.840
Hoko and the flower people have sort of 
achieved eternal life, but not eternal youth.

04:33.150 --> 04:37.320
My associates are researching that, 
but they're not done yet.

04:37.320 --> 04:41.100
Either way, the item you're looking 
for isn't on this island.

04:41.730 --> 04:44.550
<i>There's no Elixir?</i>

04:44.950 --> 04:47.260
<i>Then what's going to happen to him?</i>

04:47.740 --> 04:51.120
<i>He won't receive a pardon 
without the Elixir.</i>

04:51.620 --> 04:54.690
Anyway, your journey has come to an end.

04:54.690 --> 04:57.100
Now be good and come with me.

04:57.100 --> 04:59.840
There are a bunch of things 
I'd like to do with you.

05:01.630 --> 05:03.120
<i>Ninpo: Substitution.</i>

05:11.280 --> 05:14.590
That should be enough to kill any monster.

05:14.840 --> 05:19.060
That just leaves his underlings? 
But they seem out of it.

05:19.060 --> 05:20.470
Let's get out of here while we can.

05:21.290 --> 05:22.290
Sagirin.

05:22.290 --> 05:24.230
What? Oh, right.

05:27.480 --> 05:31.850
Thanks for helping me earlier,
 even though I ran.

05:31.850 --> 05:34.480
Are you shocked to learn about the Elixir?

05:34.480 --> 05:36.240
I get it.

05:36.720 --> 05:40.240
But our top priority is our survival.

05:40.240 --> 05:43.370
As long as we're alive, 
we'll manage somehow.

05:43.370 --> 05:45.370
First, we need to make sure we stay alive.

05:45.920 --> 05:48.180
Switch gears. It's time to run.

05:48.970 --> 05:50.250
Right.

05:51.880 --> 05:53.570
You too, Senta. Hurry.

05:53.570 --> 05:54.120
Right.

05:54.420 --> 05:57.130
Such a nice woman. You've got potential.

05:58.950 --> 06:00.880
You were wrong about one thing, though.

06:01.280 --> 06:02.880
The Kyoshi aren't my underlings.

06:08.390 --> 06:12.140
They're my toys. Funny, right?

06:13.690 --> 06:16.400
You dodged it. You've got a good eye.

06:16.400 --> 06:19.790
Rather, you can see tao, can't you?

06:19.790 --> 06:22.750
That's the first time 
I've heard the word tao.

06:22.750 --> 06:25.530
In my village, we called it qi.

06:25.530 --> 06:28.330
But you haven't mastered its use.

06:28.330 --> 06:30.550
Allow me to teach—

06:30.550 --> 06:31.670
Wait.

06:32.040 --> 06:36.550
If this will decide her life or death, 
then you'll have to go through me first.

06:36.810 --> 06:39.600
It's my job.

06:38.370 --> 06:40.330
<b>Tameshi-itto-ryu Rank 5
Yamada Asaemon
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSenta</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:43.400
The other two seem 
to have some aptitude for it,

06:43.400 --> 06:45.680
but if that's all they're 
capable of, then forget it.

06:45.680 --> 06:49.590
Shinobi, I'll teach you to use tao.

06:49.880 --> 06:52.820
If you've got the talent for it, 
then I could show you bochu jutsu,

06:52.820 --> 06:55.070
or turn you into high-quality tan.

06:55.320 --> 06:58.680
You're already his favorite.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.440
Shut up.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.930
<i>I can't believe Senta-dono drew his sword.</i>

07:02.300 --> 07:05.080
<i>For a criminal, no less.</i>

07:05.080 --> 07:08.640
<i>Does he perhaps have 
special feelings for her?</i>

07:10.180 --> 07:12.420
I'm not interested in anyone 
except the shinobi girl.

07:12.420 --> 07:13.920
Get out of the way.

07:18.560 --> 07:19.680
Sagirin!

07:19.680 --> 07:21.900
Forget about her.

07:21.900 --> 07:23.510
That was Distant Strike.

07:23.510 --> 07:25.760
It's performed by gathering 
and launching one's tao.

07:25.760 --> 07:27.990
Since ordinary humans can't learn to use it,

07:27.990 --> 07:29.430
you can forget that one.

07:29.430 --> 07:31.920
You need to start with the basic—

07:33.240 --> 07:34.200
Huh?

07:37.710 --> 07:39.570
Stay out of my way, fat boy.

07:39.570 --> 07:42.770
I told you, you have to go through me.

07:42.770 --> 07:43.620
Besides—

07:43.620 --> 07:45.200
He's right. You're in the way.

07:48.040 --> 07:52.700
If nothing can kill him, 
then I'm willing to try anything.

07:54.010 --> 07:56.000
<i>Ninpo: Slime String.</i>

07:57.490 --> 08:01.920
<i>My ninjutsu allows me to metabolize 
the medicines I swallow and secrete them.</i>

08:01.920 --> 08:04.090
<i>And this is soluble snake poison.</i>

08:05.260 --> 08:06.760
<i>Ninpo: Nectar Prison.</i>

08:07.040 --> 08:08.250
<i>And then...</i>

08:08.250 --> 08:09.760
<i>Ninpo: Grim Garrote.</i>

08:16.240 --> 08:19.530
Your abilities are an 
application of tao, aren't they?

08:19.530 --> 08:23.030
Metabolizing poisons 
alone makes you superhuman.

08:23.360 --> 08:26.470
But you're not using it very specifically.

08:26.470 --> 08:28.920
You should learn to manipulate it better.

08:29.500 --> 08:32.280
If we can create the right opportunity, 
we can look for a way to beat him.

08:33.530 --> 08:34.420
I see.

08:34.680 --> 08:35.920
Sure.

08:35.920 --> 08:38.330
Shall we try it right now?

08:47.110 --> 08:48.720
Senta, you're in the way.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.470
So are you, Yuzuriha-san.

08:56.930 --> 08:58.720
Tao is a feeling.

08:59.070 --> 09:03.240
By wearing it like clothing, 
you can sense it coming from any direction.

09:04.330 --> 09:07.480
Unless you master it, you're merely human.

09:07.480 --> 09:10.490
You're no match for us.

09:10.710 --> 09:15.120
Welcome to Horai.

09:15.120 --> 09:18.130
<i>How can we beat this monster?</i>

09:21.240 --> 09:25.820
Hoko-san, do the Tensen have any weaknesses?

09:25.820 --> 09:27.650
He's a god.

09:27.650 --> 09:30.760
If this is divine punishment, 
then I will accept it.

09:31.120 --> 09:36.480
I understand how you feel, 
but at this rate, we'll all be killed.

09:36.480 --> 09:38.560
You won't get to see Mei-san again.

09:40.660 --> 09:43.160
It can be anything. Any hint will do.

09:44.310 --> 09:48.250
That substitution you used earlier 
was an application of tao as well.

09:48.250 --> 09:50.410
Not only that, but the same type I use.

09:50.680 --> 09:51.880
Interesting.

09:51.880 --> 09:55.250
You can learn something resembling 
our Hojutsu through your own training.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.880
Well, it's time to kill the fat boy.

09:57.880 --> 09:58.850
Whoops.

09:58.850 --> 10:00.720
You recovered quickly.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.670
But you can't do anything.

10:02.920 --> 10:05.670
You have an ordinary amount of tao.

10:07.930 --> 10:10.390
Our opponent can read our 
movements and intentions.

10:10.390 --> 10:13.780
Yes, but not an intentionless path.

10:15.730 --> 10:18.260
Now cut open his tanden.

10:19.980 --> 10:23.980
The legends say tao comes from our tanden,

10:23.980 --> 10:27.140
travels through the body, 
and returns to the tanden once more.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.950
If you sever his tanden...

10:30.720 --> 10:33.370
Sorry, but there's nothing you can do.

10:33.760 --> 10:36.570
First of all, you don't have enough tao.

10:36.570 --> 10:38.870
No matter where you cut me, 
I'll just regenerate.

10:39.380 --> 10:41.990
In fact, including the shinobi girl,

10:41.990 --> 10:46.370
there isn't a human here who's 
mastered tao enough to kill me.

10:49.810 --> 10:52.110
I realized something 
after getting close to you.

10:52.110 --> 10:53.930
You're the same, after all.

10:53.930 --> 10:54.920
What?

11:04.620 --> 11:06.320
<i>He can read my movements.</i>

11:07.670 --> 11:09.470
<i>What was that?</i>

11:09.470 --> 11:12.220
<i>The size of one's tao 
is controlled by one's mind.</i>

11:12.220 --> 11:14.710
<i>Is she the type that 
instantaneously manifests hers?</i>

11:15.000 --> 11:17.860
<i>But that's not what's important.</i>

11:17.860 --> 11:20.320
<i>This woman... Could it be...?</i>

11:20.320 --> 11:21.690
Yuzuriha-san.

11:21.690 --> 11:23.960
I know. That wound...

11:24.790 --> 11:26.470
It's not regenerating.

11:32.830 --> 11:36.730
I detected a unique aura 
when I approached him.

11:37.140 --> 11:41.100
If that's tao, then I know how to cut it.

11:41.360 --> 11:44.360
Sometimes Gabimaru produces the same aura.

11:44.520 --> 11:48.870
So did Rokurota, the Giant of Bizen.

11:49.110 --> 11:52.170
Did those two use tao?

11:52.170 --> 11:53.520
It's just a guess.

11:53.860 --> 11:58.400
<i>Greater than a certain amount of tao 
is required to injure our enemy.</i>

11:58.400 --> 12:02.380
<i>Sagirin can temporarily increase 
her tao using breathing techniques.</i>

12:02.950 --> 12:04.520
<i>But that's not all.</i>

12:04.520 --> 12:07.120
<i>Why can't the Tensen regenerate?</i>

12:09.080 --> 12:11.500
I'll handle this.

12:11.500 --> 12:14.140
Such an unusual type of tao.

12:14.540 --> 12:17.880
Not only that, but it's poison to me.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.260
Marvelous.

12:20.660 --> 12:22.810
I wonder what kind of tan you'll produce.

12:22.810 --> 12:26.290
Or will you kill me?

12:27.790 --> 12:29.530
Wait, Sagiri-san.

12:30.000 --> 12:31.500
Our enemy is powerful.

12:31.500 --> 12:33.410
The three of us should work together.

12:36.920 --> 12:40.870
<i>Hojutsu: Earth Yin Night Pilgrim.</i>

12:41.280 --> 12:42.240
He vanished.

12:45.180 --> 12:46.730
He didn't vanish.

12:46.730 --> 12:50.030
He diminished his tao as much 
as possible so we couldn't detect him.

12:50.030 --> 12:52.250
It works the same way as my substitution.

12:52.250 --> 12:53.880
Cut him now.

12:54.750 --> 12:57.320
<i>My mind must be both still and active.</i>

12:58.040 --> 13:00.220
Kyoshi, kill the shinobi woman.

13:06.210 --> 13:07.500
Thanks, Senta.

13:07.500 --> 13:08.860
We're working together, remember?

13:14.870 --> 13:17.870
Nice teamwork. Thanks, Senta.

13:17.870 --> 13:18.860
You're welcome.

13:21.430 --> 13:22.960
I can read your swordsmanship,

13:22.960 --> 13:25.120
and the moment's delay makes 
your attacks easy to dodge.

13:25.330 --> 13:27.930
<i>The way I'm breathing is exhausting.</i>

13:27.930 --> 13:29.120
<i>I can't do it for long.</i>

13:33.710 --> 13:35.760
Your teamwork isn't bad.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.800
Now's my chance.

13:43.800 --> 13:44.800
You underestimate me.

13:46.810 --> 13:48.850
He flew.

13:49.350 --> 13:52.440
<i>Hojutsu: Earth Yang Sky Pilgrim.</i>

13:52.870 --> 13:55.030
By manipulating the tao in the atmosphere,

13:55.030 --> 13:57.690
one can even stand in the air.

13:58.190 --> 14:01.830
Though to those who don't 
understand how it works...

14:01.830 --> 14:04.150
I must seem like a god.

14:04.730 --> 14:06.830
This is another application of tao.

14:06.830 --> 14:09.450
Senjutsu: Tin Splinter.

14:15.140 --> 14:17.520
This is beyond our abilities.

14:18.520 --> 14:19.680
Senta-dono!

14:24.110 --> 14:25.720
<i>My vision is becoming blurry.</i>

14:26.030 --> 14:29.680
<i>That breathing technique consumes 
something other than my stamina.</i>

14:30.050 --> 14:32.300
<i>I can't keep going.</i>

14:32.300 --> 14:35.060
Don't give up yet, Sagirin.

14:35.060 --> 14:38.680
I think this is a sign our 
enemy's getting anxious.

14:38.680 --> 14:41.700
She's been making sure 
to dodge all your attacks specifically.

14:41.700 --> 14:47.000
Tao probably has matchups, 
and yours is her weakness.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.120
But that monster...

14:49.120 --> 14:52.520
That's right. It's a monster, not a god.

14:52.520 --> 14:53.710
Which means it can be killed.

14:54.280 --> 14:57.030
I'll stop her from moving, so you kill her.

14:57.480 --> 15:00.070
You're rather optimistic.

15:00.440 --> 15:01.580
This is normal.

15:01.580 --> 15:04.090
I don't intend to die here.

15:04.090 --> 15:05.560
Seriously, no way.

15:07.760 --> 15:09.060
This is pointless.

15:11.780 --> 15:12.810
Yuzuriha!

15:14.320 --> 15:17.200
You're not dodging it? You'll die.

15:27.080 --> 15:30.620
Get down here, you wannabe god.

15:31.550 --> 15:35.040
I'll kill everyone 
who interferes with my life.

15:35.040 --> 15:37.940
I'd even kill a real god.

15:39.920 --> 15:41.170
Sagirin, now.

15:42.130 --> 15:42.930
Got it.

15:46.110 --> 15:49.060
Such an obnoxious woman.

15:49.060 --> 15:51.180
Impressive work, Yuzuriha-san.

15:54.670 --> 15:57.820
Now you can't move, 
regardless of your regeneration.

15:57.820 --> 16:00.760
Do you intend to be cut down with me?

16:00.760 --> 16:03.630
Aim for a hair's breadth, Sagiri-san!

16:03.630 --> 16:04.700
You can count on me.

16:20.240 --> 16:22.220
He's not moving.

16:22.620 --> 16:25.300
Like we thought, 
that must've been his weakness.

16:25.770 --> 16:27.180
It was a gamble.

16:27.500 --> 16:29.130
But the two of us won.

16:29.130 --> 16:30.260
What about me?

16:33.400 --> 16:36.330
Hoko-san, your transformation...

16:36.330 --> 16:39.360
I still seem to be all right.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.730
Good.

16:40.730 --> 16:44.690
I can't believe there are 
six more of these monsters.

16:45.580 --> 16:47.860
Tao, the mysterious power.

16:47.860 --> 16:51.530
<i>It's even farther beyond human 
understanding than Hoko-san described.</i>

16:52.160 --> 16:54.060
<i>What is this strange exhaustion?</i>

16:54.540 --> 16:57.960
<i>Did we really defeat a Tensen so easily?</i>

16:58.770 --> 17:03.480
The biggest problem is 
that the Elixir doesn't exist.

17:04.320 --> 17:06.600
What should we do now?

17:07.440 --> 17:09.640
We'll just have to figure something out.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.440
If it doesn't exist, then it doesn't exist.

17:11.440 --> 17:12.970
We'll have to come up with another way.

17:13.320 --> 17:16.600
Aw, man. My skin is so dry.

17:16.600 --> 17:19.290
Hey, this is all gold.

17:19.290 --> 17:21.770
This much should make up 
for the lack of Elixir, right?

17:21.770 --> 17:24.790
Shall we rest a little?

17:22.480 --> 17:24.770
What a weird face. Is this a nose?

17:24.790 --> 17:26.320
Yes.

17:29.570 --> 17:32.190
Yuzuriha-san is so tenacious.

17:33.950 --> 17:38.200
Senta-dono, you seem 
to have special feelings for her.

17:38.710 --> 17:42.600
What? Oh, no, I... um...

17:42.600 --> 17:47.210
I suppose I envy how free she is.

17:47.400 --> 17:50.710
It's a foreign concept to me.

17:50.710 --> 17:52.350
What do you mean?

17:54.510 --> 17:58.230
When I was young, 
I wanted to become an artist.

17:58.230 --> 18:03.360
But in my family, boys study 
under the Yamada family.

18:03.850 --> 18:06.270
I wasn't allowed to defy that tradition.

18:07.010 --> 18:11.050
I actually didn't like the Yamada 
family or being a sword tester.

18:11.660 --> 18:14.090
I hated killing people.

18:15.580 --> 18:19.120
I spent a lot of time trying 
to rationalize killing people.

18:19.120 --> 18:22.700
It's the reason I became so 
knowledgeable about religions.

18:23.050 --> 18:28.240
Ironically, I was praised for being 
a diligent student, and my rank kept rising.

18:28.920 --> 18:31.840
Eventually, I gave up 
and closed off my heart.

18:32.440 --> 18:35.090
I began simply fulfilling my duties.

18:36.270 --> 18:41.020
You don't actually care about 
this job or your clan, do you?

18:41.020 --> 18:42.320
Actually, I—

18:42.320 --> 18:44.970
You can try to hide it, 
but I can tell, you raccoon dog.

18:45.910 --> 18:47.840
Since meeting her,

18:47.840 --> 18:50.750
I've been confounded numerous times by her cold,

18:50.750 --> 18:54.240
cruel behavior, and the way she seems
 to see right through everything.

18:55.340 --> 18:57.520
But for some reason,

18:57.520 --> 19:03.670
as someone who's been lying to himself, 
the way she only lies to others...

19:05.130 --> 19:06.990
She seems so amazingly free.

19:07.410 --> 19:10.380
I'm so jealous, it hurts.

19:10.380 --> 19:13.040
I must've fallen for her ninjutsu.

19:13.420 --> 19:16.890
I can hardly call myself an 
Asaemon when I admire a criminal.

19:19.930 --> 19:20.840
Not at all.

19:21.350 --> 19:22.690
I kind of...

19:24.630 --> 19:27.960
It's really only a little, 
but I kind of understand how you feel.

19:28.300 --> 19:36.120
Why don't we look for a way to 
save everyone who came to the island?

19:36.750 --> 19:38.320
Sagiri-san...

19:38.900 --> 19:39.750
Yes.

19:44.380 --> 19:49.670
<i>I can sense tao now, but I don't 
feel like I've mastered its use.</i>

19:50.300 --> 19:53.930
We can't ask them about 
the Elixir if you kill them.

19:55.140 --> 19:58.760
Though, judging by that conversation, 
she probably knows something.

19:58.780 --> 20:01.910
It would be cruel 
to make her show us the way,

20:01.910 --> 20:05.640
considering what those 
monsters wanted to do to her.

20:08.680 --> 20:12.500
But you followed me, didn't you?

20:13.500 --> 20:17.310
If you have some purpose or request, 
then tell me what it is.

20:17.850 --> 20:20.020
I'd like to thank you 
for saving me twice now.

20:21.040 --> 20:22.960
<i>Sagi's records said...</i>

20:23.550 --> 20:26.510
This man is not heartless after all.

20:26.510 --> 20:31.840
But his humanity only becomes apparent 
when it comes to a particular person.

20:32.080 --> 20:36.040
<i>In all other scenarios, he is heartless.</i>

20:36.040 --> 20:39.090
<i>But this is rather different 
from her records.</i>

20:39.520 --> 20:43.600
<i>How will this soft side affect his job?</i>

20:45.370 --> 20:46.320
Hey.

20:47.710 --> 20:49.060
What is...

20:51.420 --> 20:52.390
Hey.

20:53.440 --> 20:57.030
Have there always been this many flowers?

21:00.710 --> 21:01.530
Yuzuriha!

21:21.050 --> 21:29.360
The fate of an imprudent, 
cruel, and sinful killer.

21:30.100 --> 21:33.860
What I thought was common sense 
was blown away by a powerful wind.

21:37.610 --> 21:39.020
I can't get any closer.

21:39.890 --> 21:41.720
I don't need to be any closer

21:42.410 --> 21:46.480
as long as I can keep watching by her side.

21:50.590 --> 21:53.960
Huh? Am I allowed to draw right now?

21:53.960 --> 21:58.160
I feel like I was in the 
middle of doing something else.

21:58.160 --> 22:01.280
Well, whatever. I'll draw another one.

22:03.720 --> 22:08.890
Whatever... One... more...

22:27.190 --> 22:30.120
Kill me? Kill me.

22:30.960 --> 22:34.430
Yuzuriha, what should we do?

22:34.430 --> 22:38.720
We have to fight this 
monster again right now?

22:39.420 --> 22:42.120
There's no way.
